* {{imdb title|id=0101107|title=The Girl From Tomorrow Part Two: Tomorrow's End}}
* {{imdb title|id=0104343|title=The Girl from Tomorrow (movie)}}
* [http://www.ezydvd.com.au/item.zml/781693 Buy The Girl From Tomorrow on DVD]. This shop was very hard for me to find!

[[Category:Australian children's television series|Girl from Tomorrow, The]]
[[Category:Time travel television series|Girl from Tomorrow, The]]</text>
