'''''Sweet Home Alabama''''' is a [[2002 in film|2002]] [[film]] that tells the story of Melanie ([[Reese Witherspoon]]), a young woman who goes back to her home in [[Alabama]] to get [[divorce]]d from her childhood sweetheart. It also stars [[Josh Lucas]], [[Patrick Dempsey]], [[Candice Bergen]], [[Jean Smart]] and [[Fred Ward]]. [[Dakota Fanning]] makes a [[cameo appearance]] at the beginning of the film, playing a young Melanie.

The film was released on [[September 27]] [[2002]].

==Cast==
*[[Reese Witherspoon]] (Melanie Carmichael)
*[[Josh Lucas]] (Jake Perry)
*[[Patrick Dempsey]] (Andrew Hennings)
*[[Candice Bergen]] (Mayor Kate Hennings)
*[[Mary Kay Place]] (Pearl Smooter)
*[[Fred Ward]] (Earl Smooter)
*[[Jean Smart]] (Stella Kay)
*[[Ethan Embry]] (Bobby Ray)
