      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Infobox Television Survivor|
| caption = 
| image = SurvAus.jpg
| season_name = Survivor: The Australian Outback
| first_aired = [[2001]]-[[01-28]]
| last_aired = [[2001]]-[[05-03]]
| filming_started = [[2000]]-[[10-23]]
| filming_completed = [[2000]]-[[11-30]] &lt;!-- guestimated date, you need to put a day in here for proper wiki date formatting --&gt;
| location = [[Outback]], [[Australia]], near [[Cairns, Queensland|Cairns]]
| winner = [[Tina Wesson]]
| final_vote = 4-3
| number_survivors = 16
| number_days = 42
| number_episodes = 14
