:The photo is from 1931 and commonly titled &quot;[http://www.nypl.org/research/chss/spe/art/photo/hinex/empire/Icarus.html Icarus]&quot;, and [http://www.masters-of-photography.com/H/hine/hine_icarus_full.html this site] claims copyright &quot;&amp;copy; The Estate of Lewis Hine&quot;. Hine published a book entitled &quot;Men at Work&quot; in 1932 [http://www.profotos.com/education/referencedesk/masters/masters/lewishine/lewishine.shtml]; this book contained at least one version of this image (titled &quot;The Sky Boy&quot;) according to the [http://www.geh.org/fm/lwhprints/htmlsrc2/m197701650069_ful.html George Eastman House].

