*[http://www.theyworkforyou.com/mp/john_reid/airdrie_and_shotts TheyWorkForYou.com - John Reid MP]
*[http://news.bbc.co.uk/1/hi/uk_politics/2088690.stm BBC News - John Reid] profile 17 October 2002
*[http://www.guardian.co.uk/Northern_Ireland/Story/0,2763,659705,00.html The operator - John Reid profile], [[The Guardian]], March 2, 2002

