      <comment>Dopamine references removed</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Casanova''' can refer to:

*[[Giacomo Casanova]], a famous [[18th century]] [[Italy|Italian]] adventurer.

*''[[Casanova (1971 television)|Casanova]]'', a 1971 [[BBC Television]] serial.
*''[[Il Casanova di Federico Fellini]]'' also released as ''Fellini's Casanova'', a 1976 feature film.
*''[[Casanova (2005 television)|Casanova]]'', a 2005 BBC Television serial.
*''[[Casanova (film)|Casanova]]'', a 2005 feature film.
*''[[Sebastien Casanova]]''
*''[[Casanova (album)]]'' by [[The Divine Comedy (band)|The Divine Comedy]]
*[[Casanova, Haute-Corse|Casanova]], a [[commune in France|commune]] of the [[Haute-Corse]] ''[[département]]'' of [[France]], on the island of [[Corsica]].

