      <minor />
      <comment>disambiguation link repair: drug ([[Wikipedia:Disambiguation pages with links|You can help]])</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Tonic''' may mean:

* A concept from [[music]]al [[harmony (music)|harmony]] and [[musical theory]]: see [[Tonic (music)]];
* A [[carbonation|carbonated]] [[beverage]] flavoured with [[quinine]], used in [[cocktail]]s: see [[Tonic water]].
* A carbonated [[soft drink]] (&quot;tonic&quot; is a regional expression in this sense, used primarily in and around [[Boston, Massachusetts]], whereas other American locales prefer &quot;soda&quot;, &quot;pop&quot;, or &quot;coke&quot;)
* A usually liquid [[medication|drug]] given to improve health; 
* A [[patent medicine]] that claims to have tonic properties;
* A [[Tonic (band)|band]] formed in the [[1990s]].

{{disambig}}</text>
    </revision>
