      <text xml:space="preserve">{{wiktionary}}

'''Desire''' can refer to:

* [[Desire (album)]], a Bob Dylan album.
* [[Desire (DC Comics)]] of one of the Endless in Neil Gaiman's ''The Sandman'' comic series.
* a [[feeling]] of [[interpersonal attraction]].
* [[preference]], on which [[microeconomics|microeconomic theory]] is based.
* [[motivation]], thought that leads to an action.
* the concept in [[Jacques Lacan|Lacanian]] [[psychoanalysis|psychoanalytic]] theory, related to the [[Oedipus complex]].
* [[tanha]] in [[Buddhism|Buddhist]] psychology, as described in the [[Four Noble Truths]].
* [[Desire (song)]] by [[U2]] on the [[Rattle and Hum]] album/soundtrack.
* The name of the sailing ship whose crew first discovered the [[Falkland Islands]].
* [[Desire (Do As Infinity single)|Desire]], a [[Do As Infinity]] single.
* [[Desire (TV show)]] is a [[telenovela]] on the United States broadcast television network ''[[My Network TV]]''.

{{disambig}}

