'''UPM-Kymmene''' {{nyse|UPM}} is a [[Finland|Finnish]] [[pulp and paper industry|pulp and paper manufacturer]]. It has approximately 35,579 employees. UPM-Kymmene was formed by the merger of '''Kymmene Corporation''' and '''Repola Ltd''' and its subsidiary '''United Paper Mills Ltd''' in 1996. The company's oldest mill is Papeteries de Docelles located in northeastern France, which was producing traditional handpaper at the end of 15th century.

