    <title>SRA</title>
    <id>231777</id>
    <revision>
      <id>33816626</id>
      <timestamp>2006-01-04T06:57:54Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <ip>220.233.176.50</ip>
      </contributor>
      <comment>Added link to ADSL for &quot;Seamless Rate Adaption&quot;</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">The acronymn ''SRA'' can stand for:

* The [[Strategic Rail Authority]], a public company involved in the [[Rail transport in the United Kingdom|British railway system]].
* [[Rail Corporation New South Wales|New South Wales State Rail Authority]]
* [[Science Research Associates]]
* [[Sexual Recovery Anonymous]]
* [[Satanic Ritual Abuse]]
* [[Sadistic Ritual Abuse]]
* [[Student Radio Association]], group of [[student]] [[radio]] stations in the [[UK]].
* [[Senior Airman]] (SrA), a rank within the [[United States Air Force]].
* Seamless Rate Adaption, a feature of the [[ADSL2]] data communication technology.

{{TLAdisambig}}

[[de:SRA]]</text>
