        <id>394292</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>spelling: 'apparant' -&gt; 'apparent'</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Dennis Danell''' ([[June 24]], [[1961]]-- [[February 29]], [[2000]]) was the [[guitar|guitarist]] for the [[punk rock]] band [[Social Distortion]].

Danell joined Social Distortion in [[1979]] while attending high school with frontman [[Mike Ness]].  He remained the guitarist for the band until his death from an apparent [[cerebral aneurysm]].

