      <comment>/* Tracks */  Added information about two different versions of album.</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Nerf Herder''' is the [[Nerf Herder|band of the same title]]'s eponymous debut album, released in November [[1996]].

Interestingly this album was released in two different versions, both in 1996. The first version featured an orange golf shirt on the cover and was produced by My Records, [[Joey Cape]] from [[Lagwagon]]'s Record Label as it's debut album. The second version was produced by [[Arista Records]] and has a different shade of orange shirt and a different version of track 4 &quot;Easy Mark&quot;, with a completely different tempo and different lyrics.

