      <text xml:space="preserve">'''PMT''' can refer to:

*[[photomultiplier]] tube, an [[electronics|electronic]] component
*pre-menstrual tension: see [[premenstrual stress syndrome]]
*PMT: [[Pune Municipal Transport]]
*[[Potteries Motor Traction]].
* The payment function '''PMT''' in [[Microsoft Excel]], used for the calculation of mortgage payments.
* Pacific Mountain Time, used to distinguish between the different time zones.

