*[[Steve Ignorant]] - Vocals  
*[[Eve Libertine|Peeve Libido]] - Vocals, Vocals (background)  
*[[Phil Free]] - Synthesizer, Guitar
*Sybil Right - Bass  
*Paul Ellis - Strings  
*[[Penny Rimbaud|Elvis Rimbaud]] - Drums, Radio    
*Jean Paul Marat - Liner Notes  
{{Crass}}
